<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Rupali first half net falls.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Rupali first half net falls.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended</p>
<p>December 31, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales		   1,064 vs 1,479</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   46 vs   225</p>
<p>    Post-tax profit	  31 vs   150</p>
<p>    Interim dividend	nil vs   nil (per 10-rupee share)</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Rupali Polyester Ltd. The firm manufactures and markets polyester staple fibre. There is no book closure as the firm has not announced any dividend.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
